{"body": [{"y0": 67.2, "x0": 149.1, "x1": 201.5, "text": "PENSVM B"}, {"y0": 80.9, "x0": 149.1, "x1": 403.8, "text": "Iülius Cornelium et Orontem, amicos et — suós, cum uxóri-"}, {"y0": 94.8, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 403.1, "text": "bus ad — vocàvit. Cum hospités veniunt, Iülius in — lavátur."}, {"y0": 108.5, "x0": 148.6, "x1": 402.9, "text": "Aemilia eós — iubet [— salütat] et maritum suum — excüsat."}, {"y0": 123.0, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 404.2, "text": "Cornelius ad villam suam reversus ótió —. Orontés, qui ex"}, {"y0": 137.8, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 403.8, "text": "longo — revertit, vitam rüsticam nón —, sed — esse cénset."}, {"y0": 151.8, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 405.1, "text": "Hospités in atrio exspectant, dum cibus —. Servus qui in —"}, {"y0": 165.5, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 404.6, "text": "cibum coquit, — appellàtur. In — sunt trés lecti: lectus sum-"}, {"y0": 179.7, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 405.1, "text": "mus, medius, —; in singulis lectis — aut — aut terni —"}, {"y0": 193.4, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 318.7, "text": "accubant. Rómàni in lectis cubantés —."}, {"y0": 207.8, "x0": 161.2, "x1": 403.1, "text": "Tandem puer 'cénam paratam esse' —. In ménsá sunt — et"}, {"y0": 221.5, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 404.9, "text": "pocula ex — facta. Cibus omnibus —, máàximé autem —"}, {"y0": 235.4, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 404.4, "text": "laudatur. — [- servi] vinum in pócula —. Orontés vinum"}, {"y0": 248.7, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 368.9, "text": "merum —- [- bibit], céteri convivae aquam vino —."}, {"y0": 263.1, "x0": 159.8, "x1": 404.7, "text": "Sine cibó homo — vivere potest, sine aquà — tantum. —"}, {"y0": 276.9, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 404.6, "text": "mala rés est, sed multó paior est —. Ex malis minimum —"}, {"y0": 292.8, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 181.7, "text": "oportet."}, {"y0": 318.7, "x0": 149.1, "x1": 202.1, "text": "PENSVM C"}, {"y0": 332.4, "x0": 149.1, "x1": 282.0, "text": "Qui sunt Cornélius et Orontés?"}, {"y0": 346.2, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 315.6, "text": "Ubi est Iülius cum hospités adveniunt?"}, {"y0": 360.1, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 229.2, "text": "Quid est balneum?"}, {"y0": 374.5, "x0": 148.8, "x1": 283.2, "text": "Nonne iücunda est vita rüstica?"}, {"y0": 388.0, "x0": 149.1, "x1": 252.1, "text": "Quid est coci negotium?"}, {"y0": 401.9, "x0": 148.8, "x1": 316.0, "text": "Num Romaàni in sellis sedentés cénant?"}, {"y0": 415.7, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 264.3, "text": "Quot lecti sunt in triclinio?"}, {"y0": 429.6, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 326.3, "text": "Quot convivae in singulis lectis accubant?"}, {"y0": 443.6, "x0": 148.8, "x1": 324.6, "text": "Ex quà máterià pócula et vàsa facta sunt?"}, {"y0": 458.0, "x0": 148.2, "x1": 314.7, "text": "Tüne vinum aquà calida mixtum bibis?"}], "margin": [{"y0": 68.7, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 73.4, "text": "merum"}, {"y0": 75.7, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 81.7, "text": "libertünus"}, {"y0": 84.9, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 60.8, "text": "mel"}, {"y0": 93.9, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 95.3, "text": "inexspectatus"}, {"y0": 102.9, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 70.0, "text": "tardus"}, {"y0": 111.9, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 75.4, "text": "diligens"}, {"y0": 120.9, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 80.6, "text": "iücundus"}, {"y0": 130.4, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 79.1, "text": "molestus"}, {"y0": 140.0, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 65.3, "text": "imus"}, {"y0": 150.0, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 81.8, "text": "argenteus"}, {"y0": 157.6, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 79.9, "text": "gloriosus"}, {"y0": 167.3, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 70.5, "text": "acutus"}, {"y0": 177.6, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 70.0, "text": "merus"}, {"y0": 184.8, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 75.0, "text": "acerbus"}, {"y0": 193.8, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 68.7, "text": "dulcis"}, {"y0": 203.0, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 76.4, "text": "recipere"}, {"y0": 212.1, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 96.6, "text": "salvere iubére"}, {"y0": 222.2, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 68.5, "text": "visere"}, {"y0": 230.5, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 88.1, "text": "requiescere"}, {"y0": 239.5, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 61.1, "text": "frui"}, {"y0": 248.5, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 77.7, "text": "nüntiàre"}, {"y0": 257.7, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 86.0, "text": "contrahere"}, {"y0": 268.7, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 77.5, "text":